          "dense_rank": 1,
          "lexical_score": 18.166698,
          "lexical_rank": 1,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do I need a referral from a primary care doctor to book with a specialist?\nAnswer: You can book a visit with any of our practitioners without a referral.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 607,
          "chunk_index": 4,
          "similarity_score": 0.4429162,
          "dense_rank": 2,
          "lexical_score": 4.300482,
          "lexical_rank": 7,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# General practice services\n## Medical examinations for work, driving and sport\n\nWe do not carry out commercial driver (DOT) medical examinations, pilot medicals or immigration medical examinations. A sports physical before joining a team or a competition is done in a standard GP appointment.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 595,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.4082248,
          "dense_rank": 3,
          "lexical_score": 9.234943,
          "lexical_rank": 3,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: How much will my visit cost if I am paying out-of-pocket?\nAnswer: Out-of-pocket rates are $120 for a General Practitioner (GP) visit, $180 for a Dentist appointment, and $160 for all other specialist consultations.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 594,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.40154612,
          "dense_rank": 4,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "Question: What should I do if my insurance isn't listed or I am out-of-network?\nAnswer: You can pay out-of-pocket for your visit, and we can provide you with an itemized receipt to submit to your insurer for potential reimbursement.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 607,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.35470513,
          "dense_rank": 5,
          "lexical_score": 4.907004,
          "lexical_rank": 6,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# General practice services\n## Long-term conditions\n\nIf you live with a long-term condition such as type 2 diabetes, high blood pressure, asthma or COPD, your GP will agree a regular review schedule with you, usually every three or six months. Bring your home blood pressure or blood glucose readings to each review, and bring your inhalers if you have asthma or COPD, so the GP can check your technique.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 592,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.3498822,
          "dense_rank": 6,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "Question: Do you offer virtual or telehealth consultations?\nAnswer: No, we currently only offer in-person visits at our clinic location.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 608,
          "chunk_index": 3,
          "similarity_score": 0.34935772,
          "dense_rank": 7,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Procedure codes and self-pay prices\n## A code you do not recognise\n\nIf your receipt shows a code that is not in this list, the front desk can tell you what it is.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 599,
          "chunk_index": 5,
          "similarity_score": 0.34397882,
          "dense_rank": 8,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Insurance plan guide\n## Medicare and Medicaid\n\nWe accept Original Medicare (Part B) for medical visits. Medicare does not cover routine dental care, so dental appointments are self-pay for Medicare ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 605,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.3233302,
          "dense_rank": 9,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Checking in and registering\n## Language interpreters\n\nFree telephone interpreting is available in more than 200 languages for any appointment. Ask for it when you book or when you check in; there is",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 603,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.31909466,
          "dense_rank": 10,
          "lexical_score": 13.079098,
          "lexical_rank": 2,
          "considered": true,
          "chunk_text": "# Running late\n## If you are running late\n\nCall the front desk on (212) 555-0142 as soon as you know you will be late, so we can tell the practitioner and plan around it. The phone line is answered Monday through Saturday from 8:30 AM to 6:00 PM.\n\nIf you arrive up to 10 minutes after your appointment time, you will still be seen, but the appointment may be shorter so that the patients booked after you are not kept waiting. If you arrive more than 15 minutes late for a GP or specialist appointment, or more than 10 minutes late for a dental appointment, we may not be able to see you, and you will be asked to choose a new time. Dental appointments have the shorter limit because the treatment room has to be prepared and cleaned between patients.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 600,
          "chunk_index": 6,
          "similarity_score": 0.31832182,
          "dense_rank": 11,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Dental care guide\n## Services we do not offer\n\nWe do not offer teeth whitening, orthodontic treatment such as braces or clear aligners, or dental implants.",
          "text_truncated": false
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 606,
          "chunk_index": 0,
          "similarity_score": 0.31794485,
          "dense_rank": 12,
          "lexical_score": 5.298067,
          "lexical_rank": 4,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Who can see your medical record\n\nYour record can be seen only by the practitioners and staff involved in your care at the clinic, and by the staff who han",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 606,
          "chunk_index": 1,
          "similarity_score": 0.31736633,
          "dense_rank": 13,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Conversations with the chat assistant\n\nConversations with the clinic's chat assistant are kept with your appointment records. Clinic staff can read them, ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 606,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.3148101,
          "dense_rank": 14,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Your privacy and your health information\n## Recording a consultation\n\nYou may make an audio recording of your own consultation for your personal use, as long as you tell the practitioner before you ",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 604,
          "chunk_index": 2,
          "similarity_score": 0.30586994,
          "dense_rank": 15,
          "lexical_score": null,
          "lexical_rank": null,
          "considered": false,
          "chunk_text": "# Appointment reminders and messages from the clinic\n## Phone calls\n\nIf we cannot reach you by phone, we leave a voicemail with only the clinic's name, a callback number and your first name - never th",
          "text_truncated": true
        },
        {
          "entry_id": 605,
